us most anxious.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.351061683680775, "w": 0.5326803800969128, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "28 What point does the writer make about firefighters in the second paragraph?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4176603487357826, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "A The regular changes of stress levels in their working lives make them ideal", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.44599069880992026, "w": 0.8259993901815748, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "study subjects.", "x": 0.14315661824720674, "y": 0.474345794117545, "w": 0.15867981897784056, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B The strategies they use to handle stress are of particular interest to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5026761819130752, "w": 0.8259280328137266, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "researchers.", "x": 0.14315661824720674, "y": 0.5310065319872127, "w": 0.13146756884525015, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C The stressful nature of their job is typical of many public service professions.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5591885992673902, "w": 0.820206422716741, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D Their personalities makethem especially well-suited to working under stress.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5875189493415278, "w": 0.8214158070718227, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "29 What is the writer doing in the fourth paragraph?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6441796872111956, "w": 0.5536439008981493, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "A explaining their findings", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6725471551355638, "w": 0.28773646227189353, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false},